+# TLS Certificate Verification Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is that TLS certificate verification must be enabled on all builds, including development builds, with no exception carved out for dev; an earlier workaround that disabled certificate verification in development builds was explicitly retired in favor of this policy.
